{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0059","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000039:text","row":14873,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃ、そろそろ帰りますか」","en":"“Well, shall we head home?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00001","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Well then, about time I went home.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000000f3:text","row":14874,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、そうですね」","en":"“Yes, let’s.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00002","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00002","en":"Misato: \"Ahhh, yes it is.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000144:text","row":14875,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「ちょうどよい頃合いです」","en":"“This is about the right time.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00003","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00003","en":"Misato: \"It is a suitably right time.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:0000017e:text","row":14876,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「暗くなったら眠り、朝になったら起きる」","en":"“Sleep when darkness falls, rise when morning comes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00004","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00004","en":"Taichi: \"When it's dark you go to sleep, when it's light you wake up.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000001c6:text","row":14877,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「人間たるもの、そうありたいものですな？」","en":"“That is how we human beings ought to live, is it not?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00005","en":"Taichi: \"A human worth the word would want that life, right?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:0000028e:text","row":14878,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「ですねですね」","en":"“Right, right.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00006","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00006","en":"Misato: \"It is, yes it is.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:0000033c:text","row":14879,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「では本日の部活はこれでおしまいにしましょう」","en":"“Then let’s call it a day for club.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00007","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00007","en":"Misato: \"Well then, let us conclude club activities for today with this.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000382:text","row":14880,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"自然なことである。","en":"It’s only natural.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00008","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00008","en":"A natural thing, that.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000003b4:text","row":14881,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「一緒に帰りません？」","en":"“Want to walk home together?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00009","en":"Taichi: \"Shall we not go home together?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000468:text","row":14882,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「方向逆じゃないですか」","en":"“Aren’t we headed in opposite directions?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00010","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00010","en":"Misato: \"Our ways are opposite, are they not?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000004a0:text","row":14883,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうでしたっけ？」","en":"“Are we?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00011","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00011","en":"Taichi: \"Were they now?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000552:text","row":14884,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「……狼さんは、私の家を知ってるくせに」","en":"“……Mr. Wolf, you know perfectly well where I live.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00012","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00012","en":"Misato: \"...and the wolf knows my house, damn him.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000592:text","row":14885,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"ジト目で。","en":"She gives me a long, flat stare.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00013","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00013","en":"With a reproachful glare.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000005bc:text","row":14886,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「お先に失礼しますワン」","en":"“Then I’ll be going. Woof.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00014","en":"Taichi: \"I shall be rewoofing my presence, then.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000005ec:text","row":14887,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"すごすごと引き下がるしかなかった。","en":"I have no choice but to slink away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00015","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00015","en":"I had no choice but to withdraw dejectedly.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:000006fc:text","row":14888,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"そのかわり。","en":"But in return—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00016","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00016","en":"But in exchange for that,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:00000720:text","row":14889,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は俺が校舎に消えるまで、胸の前で小さく手を振って見送ってくれた。","en":"Misato sees me off with a small, chest-high wave, keeping it up until I disappear into the school building.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00017","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00017","en":"until I had completely vanished inside the building, Senpai saw me off with a waving of the hand she set right in front of her chest.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0059:0000077c:text","row":14890,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"胸キュン。","en":"My heart skips a beat.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00018","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011b:00018","en":"Heart goes 'badum'.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]}]}
